      "id": "q2",
      "type": "explain",
      "q": "Why should a lead magnet be closely related to what you sell?",
      "a": "So that the people who want it are likely clients, not just people who want something free.",
      "anchor": "#lead-magnets-and-landing-pages",
      "origin": "ai",
      "reviewed": false
    },
